WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:04.853
A story connects character choices and consequences. A parallel story uses a

00:00:04.853 --> 00:00:09.117
comparable lesson in a fresh setting without copying the original plot.

00:00:09.950 --> 00:00:14.686
Why is a story's setting useful? Answer: It tells where or when events happen.

00:00:15.533 --> 00:00:20.077
Retell a folktale's lesson, then invent a different story showing the same moral.

00:00:20.950 --> 00:00:23.937
Why it works: Setting places events in a context.
